				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "{{gtClass:TTStartUpShutDown}} is registered once and supports the pragmas {{gtPragma:ttStartUp}} and {{gtPragma:ttShutDown}} attached to #startUp:/#shutDown: methods as a convenience.\n\nThe process of registering Classes for startup and shutDown \"officially\" is more fiddly than it need be; unregistering them is doubly so.  Once the implementation of a class has settled down it may make more sense to use the official pattern.\n\nAn example of this is {{gtMethod:ImageStoreResolver class>>initialize}} which has its own priorities\n\nInstance level #startUp can be done using #allInstancesDo: (perhaps Vaults want to re-read their backing stores).\n\nThe  {{gtMethod:\nTacticalToolsHub class>>shutDownStartUpTTDryRun}}  is a good thing to know about.\n\n"
			}
		]
	},
